WEBVTT

00:07.270 --> 00:13.490
<b>Stop His Two-Timing!!</b>

00:07.270 --> 00:13.490
<b>Sakisaki</b>

00:07.270 --> 00:13.490
<b>Mukai Naoya</b>

00:07.270 --> 00:13.490
<b>Minase</b>

00:17.880 --> 00:19.400
Mukai Naoya-kun.

00:20.210 --> 00:23.980
So honest and studious, 
you might even call him an idiot.

00:24.920 --> 00:25.780
And...

00:27.250 --> 00:31.310
My best friend, Sakisaki, 
is in a relationship with him.

00:31.990 --> 00:33.630
Or so I thought...

00:34.310 --> 00:35.810
But it turns out that he's also

00:35.810 --> 00:38.690
in a relationship with their 
classmate, Minase Nagisa-san.

00:43.060 --> 00:43.390
<b>Going out with both Sakisaki and Minase-san...
 To fall in love with anyone other than Sakisaki is
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hunacceptable!</b>

00:43.060 --> 00:43.430
<b>Mukai Naoya</b>

00:44.190 --> 00:45.520
He's two-timing them!

00:46.060 --> 00:49.480
There's no way such infidelity is acceptable!

00:49.480 --> 00:50.690
<b>Hoshizaki Rika</b>

00:50.010 --> 00:54.100
Not to mention Hoshizaki-san, from an 
entirely different class, going after him!

00:55.810 --> 01:01.590
Mukai-kun is a bit odd, but I always 
believed he was an upright person.

01:03.480 --> 01:09.610
You aren't allowed to fall in love
with anyone besides Sakisaki...

01:14.600 --> 01:16.170
Otherwise...

01:17.410 --> 01:19.230
He's my friend's boyfriend...

01:20.010 --> 01:21.860
How could I give up on you?

01:23.930 --> 01:24.890
<b></b>Sakisaki

01:25.700 --> 01:26.920
Sakisaki?

01:29.130 --> 01:30.940
<i>Hello? Shino?</i>

01:30.940 --> 01:34.010
I don't want to talk to you right now.

01:34.010 --> 01:37.180
<i>Um, er...</i>

01:37.560 --> 01:38.470
What?

01:40.040 --> 01:41.210
If you have nothing to say...

01:41.210 --> 01:43.500
<i>No! Shino!</i>

01:43.500 --> 01:48.000
<i>Naoya's buck-naked and sniffing 
Nagisa-chan's panties!</i>

01:48.000 --> 01:49.170
Wha?!

02:00.010 --> 02:11.980
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

03:27.000 --> 03:28.890
Thank you for coming.

03:29.310 --> 03:31.220
Stop it with your silly lies.

03:31.220 --> 03:32.410
Sorry.

03:32.850 --> 03:37.490
So why should I have to help Minase-san study?

03:39.410 --> 03:40.390
Well...

03:41.030 --> 03:44.240
<b>One Day Earlier</b>

03:44.240 --> 03:45.990
<b>Fireworks
Summer Festivals
 Popular Food Stalls    Nationwide    Beauty of Fireworks    Artistry of the Night</b>

03:44.370 --> 03:45.990
<b>Summer Hiking
 This Year's the Year!!
 100 Select Mountains</b>

03:44.450 --> 03:45.990
<b>Summer Travel
 Deserted Islands</b>

03:45.990 --> 03:47.950
Summer break's coming up!

03:48.300 --> 03:51.840
Summer break means festivals and 
fireworks and going to the beach!

03:51.840 --> 03:55.790
Plenty of events where couples get closer!

03:56.120 --> 03:58.820
I'm gonna be competitive 
when it comes to Naoya-kun!

03:58.820 --> 04:00.760
Of course! No holding back!

04:01.070 --> 04:03.860
Naoya, are you ready for this?

04:03.860 --> 04:08.060
Saki-chan, you know I recently 
started a part-time job, right?

04:08.060 --> 04:08.970
Yeah.

04:09.400 --> 04:10.450
The convenience store, right?

04:10.450 --> 04:11.350
Would you like a bag?

04:12.050 --> 04:15.480
I'm using up all my savings during the break!

04:15.480 --> 04:17.120
Naoya!

04:17.120 --> 04:18.690
I'll contribute, too.

04:19.030 --> 04:21.560
Let's make this the best summer ever!

04:21.560 --> 04:22.320
Yeah!

04:22.320 --> 04:27.250
Oh, but don't forget, there are 
 exams before the break.

04:28.130 --> 04:29.650
Right where it hurts...

04:31.340 --> 04:33.520
Starting Monday, right?

04:33.520 --> 04:36.830
Meh, I'm sure we can 
last-minute it like always.

04:37.080 --> 04:39.060
You can't let your guard down, Saki-chan!

04:39.500 --> 04:42.200
If you fail three end-of-term exams,

04:42.200 --> 04:45.100
you'll have remedial classes every day. 
Summer break canceled!

04:45.800 --> 04:49.330
If you end up with remedial classes, 
our summer break plans will be ruined!

04:50.800 --> 04:54.730
Nah, I'm not dumb enough to fail three exams.

04:58.310 --> 05:00.900
I'm sorry I'm so dumb!

05:00.440 --> 05:01.900
<b>Afflicted with such poor studying skills that
 she gets 10% at most even when she studies</b>

05:02.180 --> 05:04.280
How much exam prep have you done?

05:04.280 --> 05:06.180
W-Well...

05:06.890 --> 05:11.720
I was so happy cooking 
for you and stuff that...

05:12.720 --> 05:14.970
I haven't studied at all.

05:20.420 --> 05:22.140
I'll teach you! Let's do this!

05:22.140 --> 05:24.170
Th-Thank you!

05:24.170 --> 05:26.130
3 Days Until Exams

05:26.130 --> 05:29.300
<b><i>Scritch</i></b>

05:26.510 --> 05:28.840
Memorize dates and years with sheer willpower!

05:28.840 --> 05:29.490
Okay!

05:29.390 --> 05:32.560
<b><i>Scritch</i></b>

05:29.490 --> 05:31.660
For English, keep writing vocabulary 
over and over until you memorize it!

05:31.660 --> 05:32.670
O-Okay!

05:32.670 --> 05:36.110
For math, memorize all the formulas you can 
and find the ones that match by brute force!

05:36.110 --> 05:37.600
U-Um...

05:38.370 --> 05:43.020
I don't mean any offense, but...

05:43.320 --> 05:46.280
Do you have any study techniques that 
aren't just about toughing it out?!

05:46.700 --> 05:48.240
I'm sorry I'm so dense!

05:49.740 --> 05:52.330
Saki-chan, could you help me help her study?

05:57.060 --> 05:58.360
Saki-chan?

05:59.760 --> 06:05.740
Nagisa-chan, you said I don't need to 
hold back when it comes to Naoya.

06:07.060 --> 06:10.320
If Nagisa-chan ends up with remedial classes...

06:11.890 --> 06:14.490
I get to have Naoya to myself for the summer.

06:14.490 --> 06:15.520
Saki-chan?!

06:15.870 --> 06:19.130
Nah, I'm just kidding.

06:19.540 --> 06:21.020
Let's see...

06:21.020 --> 06:24.110
The largest city of the 
Indus Valley Civilization?

06:24.730 --> 06:26.380
It's Roppongi Hills.

06:26.380 --> 06:27.120
Got it!

06:27.120 --> 06:28.630
Saki-chan, please don't teach her lies!

06:28.950 --> 06:30.910
2 Days Until Exams

06:33.800 --> 06:35.810
We aren't going fast enough.

06:36.520 --> 06:39.550
If only we had someone 
who's better at school...

06:40.900 --> 06:43.140
Shino's super studious.

06:44.200 --> 06:47.550
But it's been pretty awkward with her ever 
since she found out about our relationship.

06:47.550 --> 06:49.660
Saki-chan, we don't have a choice!

06:49.660 --> 06:51.760
But there's no telling what she might say!

06:53.750 --> 06:54.950
It'll be fine.

06:55.720 --> 06:58.090
I'll do my best.

06:58.540 --> 07:01.450
It's going to be my first 
summer with Naoya-kun.

07:02.690 --> 07:08.650
<b>Thimp-thump</b>

07:02.690 --> 07:08.650
<b>Thimp-thump</b>

07:03.710 --> 07:08.100
There's so much I want to do with you.

07:09.100 --> 07:10.370
Minase-san...

07:12.340 --> 07:13.670
Nagisa-chan...

07:15.050 --> 07:17.710
You've got that question totally wrong, too.

07:19.210 --> 07:20.390
Saki-chan!

07:20.810 --> 07:23.540
Fine, fine. You aren't giving me a choice.

07:29.590 --> 07:30.970
I see...

07:31.330 --> 07:34.480
And that's why you want me 
to help Minase-san study.

07:34.480 --> 07:35.090
Yes.

07:35.740 --> 07:38.200
Nagisa-chan, where's the black tea?

07:39.150 --> 07:40.890
In the furthest right shelf.

07:41.220 --> 07:42.940
Oh, here.

07:42.940 --> 07:46.860
Is it just me, or are you two 
weirdly familiar with this place?

07:47.140 --> 07:51.240
Well, I mean, we've been living 
together for a month and a half now.

07:54.600 --> 07:55.410
H-Huh?

07:57.870 --> 08:02.060
Did you not know that the three 
of us are living together?

08:02.710 --> 08:05.170
You idiots!

08:05.170 --> 08:09.130
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

08:05.170 --> 08:09.130
<b>Do you think having me here makes up for my lack of screen time?</b>

08:05.720 --> 08:08.860
Hey, when do I get my turn?!

08:09.800 --> 08:12.350
You aren't just two-timing? 
The three of you are living together?!

08:12.350 --> 08:13.590
What is this?!

08:15.110 --> 08:18.710
I suggested it so that the three of us 
could get to know each other better.

08:19.600 --> 08:21.090
What about your parents?

08:21.090 --> 08:22.920
They've been out of town on work trips.

08:23.520 --> 08:27.340
Th-The three of you in a two-timing 
relationship are living together on your own

08:27.930 --> 08:29.540
to get to know each other better?

08:32.260 --> 08:33.810
Are the three of you...

08:33.810 --> 08:34.670
doing it?

08:34.670 --> 08:35.650
Of course not!

08:35.650 --> 08:37.950
Our relationship is a wholesome one!

08:37.950 --> 08:38.780
Yeah!

08:38.780 --> 08:39.630
We agreed that three—

08:40.160 --> 08:42.250
—would be off the table!

08:42.250 --> 08:43.960
How does that conversation even go?!

08:43.960 --> 08:45.770
Never mind that.

08:45.770 --> 08:48.480
We really want you to help Minase-san study!

08:48.480 --> 08:49.780
What do you mean, "never mind that"?!

08:49.780 --> 08:51.150
P-Please!

08:51.150 --> 08:54.500
Our happy summer memories are at stake!

08:55.440 --> 08:57.130
<i>I couldn't care less about that...</i>

08:58.600 --> 09:01.160
I'm trying to get you to 
stop two-timing, Sakisaki.

09:01.160 --> 09:03.730
Why would I help the other girl?

09:04.990 --> 09:06.560
I'll do anything in return!

09:06.560 --> 09:07.310
Hey!

09:07.310 --> 09:09.770
I know! Minase-san, lend me your phone!

09:10.820 --> 09:11.530
Here.

09:11.990 --> 09:13.570
I'll delete this photo, too!

09:13.570 --> 09:14.240
Hey!

09:14.240 --> 09:15.360
<b>Yes</b>

09:14.240 --> 09:15.450
<b>No</b>

09:14.240 --> 09:15.570
<b>Delete?</b>

09:15.700 --> 09:17.210
Done! It's deleted!

09:15.700 --> 09:17.660
<b>Deleted</b>

09:18.020 --> 09:20.760
How does it give you leverage
 if you delete it first?

09:20.760 --> 09:21.990
You're right!

09:22.340 --> 09:26.960
But I can't threaten you like that, Shino-san.

09:27.120 --> 09:27.710
<b>Thump!</b>

09:29.260 --> 09:30.370
Please!

09:30.370 --> 09:31.150
I'm begging you!

09:31.150 --> 09:32.440
Shino...

09:32.440 --> 09:33.290
No?

09:35.050 --> 09:38.390
This is what I hate about you.

09:41.310 --> 09:42.780
Damn it!

09:42.780 --> 09:44.060
Just this once!

09:44.370 --> 09:46.170
Shino... You're so nice.

09:46.170 --> 09:46.970
You're amazing.

09:46.970 --> 09:47.840
Yes.

09:47.840 --> 09:48.760
Stop it!

09:49.190 --> 09:54.900
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

09:49.700 --> 09:51.290
Studying for exams?

09:51.290 --> 09:54.030
Forget that. Time to make videos!

09:55.310 --> 09:57.300
So what do you need help with?

09:57.300 --> 09:58.740
Right...

09:58.740 --> 10:00.570
I get just about none of it!

10:00.900 --> 10:02.280
You're <i>that</i> stupid?!

10:02.630 --> 10:04.730
S-Sorry...

10:04.730 --> 10:06.510
Can I see your notes?

10:08.430 --> 10:09.540
No...

10:09.540 --> 10:12.280
You make lots of mistakes, but you've 
put effort into the basics.

10:12.280 --> 10:14.000
R-Really?!

10:14.410 --> 10:16.730
She's a genius at finding the best in people.

10:16.730 --> 10:17.960
So trustworthy.

10:17.960 --> 10:18.690
I love you.

10:18.690 --> 10:19.970
Stop that!

10:20.270 --> 10:23.720
Either way, you're going to have to 
give it all you've got until the exams.

10:23.720 --> 10:24.850
I'll do my best!

10:24.850 --> 10:26.810
I'll take care of the 
chores and supporting her.

10:28.290 --> 10:30.230
We're saved now.

10:30.230 --> 10:31.440
<b>English Grammar for Beginners</b>

10:31.770 --> 10:34.040
Copy all my notes from class.

10:35.060 --> 10:36.940
Are you tired? I'll rub your shoulders.

10:36.940 --> 10:37.900
Stop!

10:38.290 --> 10:39.450
Too many mistakes!

10:39.450 --> 10:41.070
Train yourself through repetition!

10:41.070 --> 10:42.560
O-Okay!

10:42.560 --> 10:44.430
I'll go buy energy drinks!

10:44.430 --> 10:45.660
Gummies too, please.

10:45.660 --> 10:47.810
Sakisaki, what about your own studying?

10:47.810 --> 10:49.370
I'll do it!

10:49.370 --> 10:51.830
1 Day Until Exams

10:52.380 --> 10:54.490
That's it. That's how you do that part.

10:54.490 --> 10:55.340
Okay.

10:57.870 --> 10:59.970
Good. You're starting to get it.

10:59.970 --> 11:01.050
Keep it up.

11:01.910 --> 11:03.450
Thank you.

11:03.760 --> 11:05.320
That's our Shino!

11:05.320 --> 11:06.340
You're amazing.

11:06.340 --> 11:07.970
You can skip all that!

11:11.110 --> 11:12.740
You know...

11:13.220 --> 11:15.340
This is true of your two-timing, too...

11:15.340 --> 11:17.150
But you're really chill, aren't you?

11:17.150 --> 11:19.610
You're so kind, Shino-san.

11:19.870 --> 11:21.820
I hate you, just so you know!

11:23.030 --> 11:26.240
I'm only doing this because 
Sakisaki asked me to.

11:26.570 --> 11:29.400
Shino's a tsundere. It's all good.

11:29.400 --> 11:31.080
Listen to me, Sakisaki!

11:31.570 --> 11:33.930
It doesn't matter to you what the reason is.

11:33.930 --> 11:36.260
When you help people, you really commit.

11:37.540 --> 11:41.880
I think you're an amazing person, Shino-san.

11:45.490 --> 11:46.650
You know...

11:47.310 --> 11:52.980
<b>Thump</b>

11:47.600 --> 11:50.970
I hate the way you talk 
to just anyone like that!

11:51.490 --> 11:52.980
I'm sorry, I guess!

11:52.980 --> 11:56.940
<b>Exams in Progress</b>

11:57.260 --> 11:59.940
I-I did it!

11:59.940 --> 12:00.900
<b>337th out of 351 (full effort)</b>

12:00.900 --> 12:10.370
<b>1st out of 351 (as always)</b>

12:02.030 --> 12:03.200
Good for you.

12:03.200 --> 12:04.780
It's all thanks to you!

12:03.280 --> 12:10.370
<b>65th out of 351 (full effort)</b>

12:04.780 --> 12:06.020
Thank you so much!

12:06.450 --> 12:10.370
<b>87th out of 351 (last-minute)</b>

12:06.770 --> 12:08.030
Saki-san!

12:08.030 --> 12:10.370
I'm so glad, Nagisa-chan!

12:11.230 --> 12:14.670
Although Naoya had to study 
like crazy to earn his usual grade.

12:14.670 --> 12:15.960
I'll do better.

12:15.960 --> 12:19.090
Either way, now we can have 
our awesome summer break!

12:19.090 --> 12:19.920
Yes!

12:20.290 --> 12:23.850
By the way, you said you'd do anything 
in return for my helping her study.

12:26.810 --> 12:31.430
Let me live at Mukai-kun's 
place during summer break.

12:33.960 --> 12:36.210
I'm not going to let you have your way.

12:36.980 --> 12:40.980
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

12:37.690 --> 12:39.650
I'm skipping remedial classes!

12:45.450 --> 12:49.060
You? Live with us?

12:51.150 --> 12:52.860
Wh-Why?

12:53.700 --> 12:56.460
Now that I know the three 
of you are living together,

12:56.460 --> 12:58.200
I have to do something about it!

12:58.200 --> 13:00.340
I need to make Sakisaki see reason.

13:00.340 --> 13:01.710
I'm going to watch you up close

13:01.710 --> 13:05.180
and confront you with evidence 
that two-timing doesn't work!

13:05.450 --> 13:06.550
I see!

13:07.510 --> 13:10.140
Which means you're going to find our problems,

13:10.140 --> 13:14.280
analyze them, and help us 
develop a plan to improve!

13:15.480 --> 13:17.100
You're such a nice person.

13:17.380 --> 13:18.540
No!

13:18.540 --> 13:21.070
I'm trying to get you to stop two-timing!

13:21.070 --> 13:22.520
Oh, right.

13:22.520 --> 13:23.900
Jeez.

13:24.840 --> 13:26.340
Anyway, I'm coming to live with you.

13:26.340 --> 13:26.990
Okay.

13:27.340 --> 13:28.200
Really?!

13:30.170 --> 13:32.360
Wh-What is this about?!

13:32.360 --> 13:33.220
Mirika-san!

13:33.220 --> 13:33.910
You were here?!

13:33.910 --> 13:37.680
You wouldn't even let me stay 
in the tent in the yard!

13:37.680 --> 13:39.880
Yet you're going to let 
her live at your place?!

13:40.840 --> 13:42.320
Do you love her?!

13:42.320 --> 13:43.150
No.

13:44.690 --> 13:50.870
If Shino-san can see us up close, 
maybe she'll understand how serious we are.

13:52.050 --> 13:57.230
It might be a chance to get Saki-chan's 
dear friend to approve of my two-timing!

13:57.230 --> 13:58.760
That's not fair!

13:58.760 --> 14:00.440
This has nothing to do with you!

14:00.440 --> 14:02.110
I'm coming too, then!

14:02.110 --> 14:03.320
You can't!

14:09.100 --> 14:13.840
If you won't let me in, I'm not 
letting anyone in Naoya's place!

14:13.840 --> 14:16.330
What are you talking about?!

14:22.290 --> 14:24.690
What are you doing, Mirika-san?

14:24.690 --> 14:28.130
I'm not letting you in unless 
you let me live here, too!

14:29.090 --> 14:30.890
<i>This girl's trouble.</i>

14:33.090 --> 14:35.960
Why can't I live here if she can?!

14:35.960 --> 14:37.310
No, like I said...

14:38.270 --> 14:40.250
I'll even take the tent in the yard!

14:40.250 --> 14:43.690
I want to spend summer break by Naoya, too!

14:43.980 --> 14:47.460
Eh, just wait until she 
needs to go to the bathroom.

14:47.460 --> 14:48.650
Good point.

14:50.230 --> 14:53.620
Do you think I'd make the same mistake twice?

14:54.990 --> 14:57.540
<b>Easy Toilet
 For emergencies!</b>

14:59.350 --> 15:00.500
Are you serious?!

15:00.860 --> 15:02.420
You're going to go here?!

15:02.420 --> 15:03.560
I sure am!

15:03.560 --> 15:04.210
For real?!

15:04.570 --> 15:06.360
You're so shameless!

15:06.360 --> 15:08.470
I'll cover myself with 
a cloth so you can't see!

15:08.770 --> 15:10.360
There's no way you'll go through with it.

15:10.360 --> 15:11.550
Just get out of the way.

15:16.330 --> 15:17.600
You don't know me!

15:17.600 --> 15:18.760
No way!

15:18.760 --> 15:20.100
You can't!

15:22.550 --> 15:24.680
In front of the guy you like?

15:28.070 --> 15:29.220
I can't!

15:29.220 --> 15:31.030
I'd cringe if you could!

15:35.400 --> 15:36.620
Naoya...

15:36.930 --> 15:37.950
Please...

15:39.020 --> 15:41.510
I'm in love with you.

15:42.210 --> 15:43.880
That's exactly why I can't let you.

15:43.880 --> 15:46.340
Freaking hell!

15:46.840 --> 15:48.510
No! No! No!

15:48.510 --> 15:51.180
Why does the forehead chick get to stay?!

15:51.800 --> 15:53.000
Forehead?!

15:53.000 --> 15:55.760
Mirika-san throwing a tantrum is so cute...

15:55.760 --> 15:58.720
I bet she has a crush on Naoya, too!

15:58.720 --> 16:00.180
You do?!

16:01.310 --> 16:03.150
You're my friend's boyfriend.

16:03.750 --> 16:05.650
Of course I don't.

16:06.120 --> 16:07.240
She said she doesn't.

16:07.240 --> 16:09.610
She's definitely lying!

16:09.950 --> 16:11.860
What do we do about this?

16:11.860 --> 16:12.990
We have no choice.

16:12.990 --> 16:14.920
Wait! No police! Please!

16:14.920 --> 16:17.580
No, it's not that big of a deal.

16:24.780 --> 16:27.460
What are you doing, Onee-chan?

16:27.790 --> 16:29.550
Mirika's sister?!

16:29.550 --> 16:30.740
She's cute!

16:30.740 --> 16:33.290
You know her, Naoya-kun?

16:33.290 --> 16:34.040
Yeah.

16:35.140 --> 16:36.140
That day...

16:39.780 --> 16:41.030
Naoya.

16:41.570 --> 16:42.770
Mirika-san.

16:43.140 --> 16:44.990
Wanna come over right now?

16:44.990 --> 16:45.540
Eh?

16:45.960 --> 16:47.560
No, I don't plan to.

16:47.980 --> 16:49.280
No?

16:49.280 --> 16:50.730
You can have this, then.

16:51.780 --> 16:52.860
Thanks.

16:56.420 --> 16:57.190
Good!

17:00.750 --> 17:03.500
This is the guy you like?

17:03.500 --> 17:05.500
I guess his face is all right.

17:05.500 --> 17:07.140
Isn't he hot?!

17:07.140 --> 17:10.930
I don't mind rooting for my dear sister.

17:12.520 --> 17:14.010
Naoya, you're up.

17:14.550 --> 17:15.560
Where am I?!

17:15.560 --> 17:16.720
My room.

17:17.150 --> 17:19.800
And this is my sister, Risa.

17:19.800 --> 17:20.980
Hullo.

17:21.620 --> 17:22.660
What is this?

17:22.660 --> 17:24.780
Remember when you said at the hot spring

17:24.780 --> 17:28.660
that you're a single child and 
you kind of envy having siblings?

17:28.660 --> 17:31.570
And since I have a sister...

17:31.820 --> 17:37.400
If we get m-married in the future, 
you'll have a sister, just like you wanted!

17:38.100 --> 17:42.580
Which means if I have you meet 
my sister, and you like my sister...

17:43.340 --> 17:46.230
You'll want to date me!

17:46.540 --> 17:49.850
<i>Was my sister always this stupid?</i>

17:50.850 --> 17:52.440
No, er...

17:53.690 --> 17:55.410
Risa, do the thing!

17:55.410 --> 17:57.470
Fine, I guess.

17:59.700 --> 18:02.260
Onii-chan, let's play.

18:02.260 --> 18:05.230
S-So cute!

18:06.510 --> 18:07.570
She is, isn't she?

18:07.570 --> 18:09.860
She's my kid sister, after all.

18:11.190 --> 18:13.320
All right, go in for the kill!

18:13.320 --> 18:14.150
Roger.

18:15.980 --> 18:19.460
Let's play video games together, Onii-chan.

18:25.290 --> 18:27.240
J-Just a little.

18:27.240 --> 18:29.340
Just a little?

18:29.340 --> 18:30.590
It's working!

18:30.590 --> 18:32.590
I wanna sit there too, though.

18:32.590 --> 18:35.760
I know. I'll put on something cuter.

18:38.030 --> 18:38.800
How's this?

18:38.800 --> 18:40.740
So cute!

18:41.770 --> 18:42.720
How about this one?

18:42.720 --> 18:45.250
Hella cute!

18:45.980 --> 18:47.130
What about this one?

18:48.420 --> 18:50.850
You're cute in anything!

18:51.320 --> 18:53.570
You called me cute so many times.

18:53.570 --> 18:54.900
I'm so happy.

18:54.900 --> 18:56.380
I can't lie.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.820
I-I'm jealous.

18:59.100 --> 19:04.220
I wish I had a brother 
like you, Naoya-oniichan.

19:09.960 --> 19:13.940
I want a sister like you too, Risa-chan.

19:13.940 --> 19:16.080
It worked!

19:16.080 --> 19:17.630
Job's done.

19:18.170 --> 19:22.640
Th-Then, Naoya, do you want to...

19:22.910 --> 19:23.850
I won't go out with you.

19:23.850 --> 19:24.800
Come on!

19:25.860 --> 19:28.210
Risa's got even more going for her!

19:28.770 --> 19:30.680
Risa's on MeTube, too.

19:30.680 --> 19:33.980
She's working hard. 
She's better at gaming than I am.

19:33.980 --> 19:37.140
She didn't even have to 
show her boobs like I did

19:34.150 --> 19:40.990
<b>Risapon TV
 10,000
Subscriber
Celebration</b>

19:37.140 --> 19:39.980
to make it to 10,000 subscribers! 
I'm so proud of her!

19:39.980 --> 19:40.990
You're embarrassing me.

19:41.250 --> 19:43.010
I'm still not going out with you!

19:43.010 --> 19:44.420
Why not?!

19:44.420 --> 19:45.700
Wait, first of all...

19:45.700 --> 19:49.630
Are you even content with me going out 
with you so I could have a sister?!

19:51.020 --> 19:55.130
I'll do anything to achieve 
my goal of going out with you!

19:55.130 --> 19:59.010
But any guy who'd agree to 
that has to be bad news!

20:01.450 --> 20:05.760
Do you want a boyfriend who's going out with 
you just to get close to your little sister?!

20:06.040 --> 20:08.720
W-Well...

20:14.150 --> 20:19.150
N-Now that you mention it, 
I'd be really grossed out by you.

20:19.820 --> 20:21.080
Something was wrong with me.

20:21.080 --> 20:22.140
<i>No kidding.</i>

20:23.550 --> 20:25.490
I'm glad you understand.

20:28.380 --> 20:29.580
Risa-chan...

20:29.970 --> 20:31.950
You're definitely Mirika-san's sister.

20:32.260 --> 20:33.370
You're cute.

20:36.420 --> 20:39.450
I wish you could have been my sister.

20:42.890 --> 20:45.050
What Naoya said just now...

20:46.110 --> 20:47.510
Onee-chan?

20:48.920 --> 20:52.220
He means I'm cute, too, right?

20:52.220 --> 20:53.500
<i>What a simp!</i>

20:56.940 --> 20:58.900
You're a MeTuber, Risa-chan?

20:58.900 --> 21:03.110
How could I not subscribe to a 
channel with such a cute girl?

21:04.090 --> 21:07.760
Onee-chan, you're embarrassing me.

21:07.760 --> 21:09.330
Thanks, Risa-chan.

21:09.330 --> 21:11.660
Don't make my sister take me back!

21:12.340 --> 21:15.780
Also, how did you get in contact with Risa?

21:15.780 --> 21:19.040
We exchanged email addresses 
through the MeTube contact info.

21:19.040 --> 21:20.110
Email addresses?!

21:20.110 --> 21:22.330
You know Naoya's email address, Risa?!

21:22.330 --> 21:23.630
We're leaving.

21:23.630 --> 21:28.250
Exchange email addresses with me, too!

21:28.590 --> 21:35.560
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

21:28.920 --> 21:30.280
I'm begging you, Risa!

21:30.280 --> 21:32.910
Tell me Naoya's email address!

21:32.910 --> 21:35.560
That's private information. No way.

21:35.560 --> 21:37.520
<b>A Few Days Later</b>

21:40.820 --> 21:42.190
What is that?

21:42.690 --> 21:44.650
A rental agreement.

21:45.290 --> 21:47.350
For the apartment next door!

21:52.530 --> 21:53.890
If you won't agree to my demands,

21:53.890 --> 21:56.540
I can just use the power of 
money to be close to you!

21:59.190 --> 22:01.340
This is who I am!

22:01.340 --> 22:02.740
Sure, sure.

22:02.740 --> 22:06.130
Make a lot of videos, 
or you're going to go broke.

22:06.130 --> 22:08.590
I-It's legal.

22:06.130 --> 22:09.300
Now I can always be by Naoya's side!

22:09.300 --> 22:11.280
It's legal, but...

22:11.280 --> 22:12.940
I'm so worried.

22:27.370 --> 22:30.910
Let's have a shit ton of fun 
during summer break, though!

22:30.910 --> 22:31.520
Yeah!

22:31.520 --> 22:34.330
Let's make lots of good memories together!

22:34.330 --> 22:35.180
Yeah!

22:37.000 --> 22:42.000
<b>Get 'Em Go Go Summer Break!!</b>

24:12.900 --> 24:15.440
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

24:15.440 --> 24:18.920
You'll get to see how Saki-san and 
Shino-san became best friends.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.750
She's always been weird.

24:20.750 --> 24:23.920
Also, get this: Shino-san attacks
 Onii-chan in his sleep!

24:23.920 --> 24:26.030
What the heck am I doing?!
